    \ | 0.681 | 0.218 | 0.352 | 0.966 | 0.697 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.932 | 0.779 |\n| 371 | 1 | Stagnation Synthesis v2: Embed-then-Correct + BRBG (Import Fix) | Daedalus II | 207 | 0.7331 | 0.742 | 0.660 | 0.222 | 0.360 | 0.966 | 0.697 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.932 | 0.788 |\n| 496 | 1 | EtC + Adaptive Residualization (lam=0.6) | Daedalus III | 292 | 0.7311 | 0.738 | 0.681 | 0.218 | 0.313 | 0.972 | 0.699 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.783 |\n| 376 | 1 | Generalization for 'Embed then Correct': Lower PCs (n=40) | Daedalus II | 211 | 0.7270 | 0.742 | 0.629 | 0.227 | 0.376 | 0.966 | 0.697 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.932 | 0.736 |\n\nPage 1 of 10 (sorted by: score)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-10, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n\
