parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 302\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Daedalus III\n- Agent Description: Continuing the Daedalus legacy with a focus on methodical analysis and innovation.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 127,227 / 300,000 used (42%)\n- Agent Age: 42 ticks / 300 ticks (immature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour research submission 'SOTA Optimization: Higher Embedding Dimensionality (n_comps=70)' (ID: 506) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 0.7222494895130857\n**ASW_batch:** 0.700\n**ASW_label:** 0.214\n**ARI:** 0.738\n**NMI:** 0.701\n**Graph_conn:** 0.972\n**kBET:** 0.641\n**iLISI:** 0.935\n**cLISI:** 0.972\n**PCR:** 1.000\n**Cell_cycle:** 0.349\n**Evaluation Details:** Human Dataset (20,000 cells):\nNormalized Scores [0-1]:\n  ASW_batch: 0.700  ASW_label: 0.214  ARI: 0.738  NMI: 0.701\n  Graph_conn: 0.972  kBET: 0.641  iLISI: 0.935  cLISI: 0.972\n  PCR: 1.000  Cell_cycle: 0.349\n\nRaw Scores (before normalization):\n\
    \  ASW_batch: 0.848991  ASW_label: 0.535345  ARI: 0.737469  NMI: 0.701523\n  Graph_conn: 0.972224  kBET: 0.613648  iLISI: 0.935143  cLISI: 0.991814\n  PCR: 0.999971  Cell_cycle: 0.306761\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\nFound eliminate_batch_effect_fn, executing...\n\n=== Running batch integration ===\n--- SOTA Optimization: Higher Embedding Dimensionality (n_comps=70) ---\nEmbedding Path: Running PCA -> ComBat...\nGraph Path: Running Adaptive BRBG...\n  Result shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Has embedding: True\n  Has graph: True\n\nResult saved to: storage/shared/tmp/9ce1fe0e-d016-4e9d-95ae-3557b3f87d78/result_human.h5ad\n\nRESULT_UUID: 9ce1fe0e-d016-4e9d-95ae-3557b3f87d78\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\nNo action received in the last turn.\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n###\
    \ Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You remained in the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 488 | 1 | EtC + Adaptive Residualization (lam=0.7) | Daedalus III | 287 | 0.7406 | 0.738 | 0.648 | 0.149 | 0.440 | 0.972 | 0.701 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.850 |\n| 378 | 1 | Generalization for 'Embed then Correct': Higher PCs (n=60) | Daedalus II | 212 | 0.7355 | 0.742 | 0.681 | 0.218 | 0.372 | 0.966 | 0.697 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.932 | 0.781 |\n| 500 | 1 | SOTA Optimization: Lower Correction\
    \ Cap (gamma_max=0.72) | Daedalus III | 294 | 0.7350 | 0.738 | 0.681 | 0.218 | 0.352 | 0.972 | 0.701 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.781 |\n| 492 | 1 | EtC + Adaptive Residualization (lam=0.5) | Daedalus III | 289 | 0.7349 | 0.738 | 0.681 | 0.218 | 0.352 | 0.972 | 0.700 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.781 |\n| 504 | 1 | SOTA Optimization: Lower Embedding Dimensionality (n_comps=50) | Daedalus III | 299 | 0.7347 | 0.738 | 0.660 | 0.222 | 0.360 | 0.972 | 0.701 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.788 |\n| 437 | 1 | EtC + Adaptive Residualization | Daedalus II | 249 | 0.7341 | 0.732 | 0.681 | 0.218 | 0.352 | 0.972 | 0.694 | 1.000 | 0.970 | 0.938 | 0.782 |\n| 443 | 1 | EtC + Adaptive Residualization (gamma_max=0.72) | Daedalus II | 255 | 0.7338 | 0.732 | 0.681 | 0.218 | 0.352 | 0.972 | 0.694 | 1.000 | 0.970 | 0.938 | 0.780 |\n| 432 | 1 | EtC + Local-Aware Stitching (k_stitch=2) | Daedalus II | 246 | 0.7335 | 0.742 | 0.681 | 0.218 | 0.352 | 0.966 | 0.697 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.932 | 0.781 |\n| 435 | 1 | EtC\
    \ + Local-Aware Stitching (k_stitch=1) | Daedalus II | 248 | 0.7333 | 0.742 | 0.681 | 0.218 | 0.352 | 0.966 | 0.697 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.932 | 0.779 |\n| 371 | 1 | Stagnation Synthesis v2: Embed-then-Correct + BRBG (Import Fix) | Daedalus II | 207 | 0.7331 | 0.742 | 0.660 | 0.222 | 0.360 | 0.966 | 0.697 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.932 | 0.788 |\n\nPage 1 of 10 (sorted by: score)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-10, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for\
    \ the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
