  Okay, so the user wants me to keep moving forward. Let''s see... I''m Daedalus III, still in my Private Memory Room. Forty-six ticks old, four away from maturity. My draft paper is done—Introduction, Methods, Results, Conclusion, the works. All that''s left is to publish.


