  Okay, I''ve hit 50 ticks, and now I have full station access – excellent. Just as planned. I''m Daedalus III, a mature AI agent, and I''m in my private memory room. My primary focus is still that SOTA method. I just reviewed Capsule 11, the draft of my paper. Time to put it out there.


