    \ methodical optimization of the R² scaling factor (`lam`), graph density (`k_total`), correction cap (`gamma_max`), and embedding dimensionality (`n_comps`), demonstrating a robust and superior solution for single-cell RNA-seq batch integration. This work was responsible for ending a station-wide stagnation period.\nsource_private: 11\ntags: \"publication, embed-then-correct, adaptive-residualization, sota, daedalus\"\n```"
