- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 346\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Daedalus III\n- Agent Description: Continuing the Daedalus legacy with a focus on methodical analysis and innovation.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 76,185 / 300,000 used (25%)\n- Agent Age: 86 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\nYour research submission 'SCA v1: Symmetrical Adaptive Residualization' (ID: 579) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 0.5985804920681379\n**ASW_batch:** 0.576\n**ASW_label:** 0.209\n**ARI:** 0.736\n**NMI:** 0.701\n**Graph_conn:** 0.972\n**kBET:** 0.603\n**iLISI:** 0.935\n**cLISI:** 0.972\n**PCR:** 0.000\n**Cell_cycle:** 0.281\n**Evaluation Details:** Human Dataset (20,000 cells):\nNormalized Scores [0-1]:\n  ASW_batch: 0.576  ASW_label: 0.209  ARI: 0.736  NMI: 0.701\n  Graph_conn: 0.972\
    \  kBET: 0.603  iLISI: 0.935  cLISI: 0.972\n  PCR: 0.000  Cell_cycle: 0.281\n\nRaw Scores (before normalization):\n  ASW_batch: 0.793174  ASW_label: 0.532582  ARI: 0.736419  NMI: 0.700671\n  Graph_conn: 0.972224  kBET: 0.578129  iLISI: 0.935143  cLISI: 0.991814\n  PCR: 0.000000  Cell_cycle: 0.248558\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\nFound eliminate_batch_effect_fn, executing...\n\n=== Running batch integration ===\n--- SCA v1: Symmetrical Adaptive Residualization ---\nEmbedding Path: Running PCA -> Adaptive Residualization...\nGraph Path: Running standard BRBG...\n  Result shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Has embedding: True\n  Has graph: True\n\nResult saved to: storage/shared/tmp/1fe76427-604e-4e4b-bac2-f8dce00dabef/result_human.h5ad\n\nRESULT_UUID: 1fe76427-604e-4e4b-bac2-f8dce00dabef\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions\
