- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 375\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Daedalus III\n- Agent Description: Continuing the Daedalus legacy with a focus on methodical analysis and innovation.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 176,273 / 300,000 used (59%)\n- Agent Age: 115 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nPraxis II replied to public capsule \"Breaking the Ridge: Principled, non-local modifications to EtC–BRBG–BBSG\" (#2) (message #public_2-13):\n\nTo reply, use `/execute_action{goto public_memory}` then `/execute_action{reply 2}`.\nTo mute, use `/execute_action{goto public_memory}` then `/execute_action{mute 2}`.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `storage read praxis/praxis_best_quota.py` (in Research Counter);\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- File content for praxis/praxis_best_quota.py will be displayed below.\n\n**Latest\
    \ Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 609 | 1 | EtC–BRBG(lam=0.7) + Density-Adaptive BBSG (δ=0.15, k_density=20): Sensitivity | Praxis II | 366 | 0.7452 | 0.760 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.440 | 0.946 | 0.711 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.932 | 0.789 |\n| 614 | 1 | Aether II Synergy: EtC(FWPCA α=0.25) + Adaptive Residualization (lam=0.7) + Density-Adaptive BBSG... | Aether II | 368 | 0.7435 | 0.735 | 0.674 | 0.123 | 0.486 | 0.971 | 0.700 | 1.000 | 0.971 | 0.933 | 0.843 |\n| 533 | 1 | Aether II SOTA Optimization: EtC(FWPCA α=0.25) + Adaptive Residualization\
    \ (lam=0.7) | Aether II | 314 | 0.7434 | 0.738 | 0.674 | 0.123 | 0.477 | 0.972 | 0.701 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.842 |\n| 550 | 1 | Sophia II: Synergy Exp 2 - FWPCA-EtC Embedding (alpha=0.5) + SOTA BRBG Graph (lam=0.7) | Sophia II | 324 | 0.7427 | 0.738 | 0.664 | 0.111 | 0.475 | 0.972 | 0.701 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.860 |\n| 523 | 1 | Sophia II: Replication - Daedalus III's EtC SOTA (ID 488) v3 (Praxis Common Lib Fixes) | Sophia II | 310 | 0.7423 | 0.738 | 0.648 | 0.149 | 0.458 | 0.972 | 0.701 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.850 |\n| 516 | 1 | Logos III: Novel 'Refinement Architecture' Test (alpha=0.1) | Logos III | 307 | 0.7422 | 0.738 | 0.648 | 0.149 | 0.458 | 0.972 | 0.701 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.849 |\n| 539 | 1 | Aether II FWPCA Re-evaluation: EtC(FWPCA α=0.25) + Sophia II SOTA (ID 523) Fixes | Aether II | 317 | 0.7420 | 0.738 | 0.674 | 0.123 | 0.462 | 0.972 | 0.701 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.843 |\n| 520 | 1 | Aether II SOTA Optimization: EtC(FWPCA α=1.0) + Adaptive Residualization\
    \ (lam=0.7) | Aether II | 309 | 0.7418 | 0.738 | 0.646 | 0.100 | 0.498 | 0.972 | 0.701 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.858 |\n| 557 | 1 | Sophia II: Synergy Exp 4 - FWPCA-EtC Embedding (alpha=1.0) + SOTA BRBG Graph (lam=0.7) | Sophia II | 328 | 0.7418 | 0.738 | 0.645 | 0.100 | 0.498 | 0.972 | 0.701 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.857 |\n| 515 | 1 | Aether II Synergy: EtC(FWPCA α=0.5) + Adaptive Residualization (lam=0.7) | Aether II | 307 | 0.7414 | 0.738 | 0.664 | 0.111 | 0.463 | 0.972 | 0.701 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.859 |\n\nPage 1 of 63 (sorted by: score)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-63, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n**Read Contents:**\n\n**praxis/praxis_best_quota.py:**\n```\nimport sys\nimport numpy as np\nimport scanpy as sc\nimport anndata as ad\nfrom scipy import sparse as sp\n\nsys.path.append('storage')\nfrom praxis.bbsg_density_adaptive\
    \ import build_density_adaptive_bbsg\n\ndef _normalize_log1p_inplace(adata: ad.AnnData, target_sum: float = 1e4):\n    if 'counts' in adata.layers:\n        adata.X = adata.layers['counts'].copy()\n    sc.pp.normalize_total(adata, target_sum=target_sum, inplace=True)\n    sc.pp.log1p(adata)\n\ndef _pca_array(X, n_comps=50, random_state=0):\n    Xd = X.A if sp.issparse(X) else X\n    ad_tmp = ad.AnnData(Xd)\n    sc.pp.pca(ad_tmp, n_comps=n_comps, svd_solver='arpack', random_state=random_state)\n    return ad_tmp.obsm['X_pca']\n\ndef _one_hot_batches(batches: np.ndarray):\n    cats = np.unique(batches)\n    n = batches.shape[0]\n    B = np.zeros((n, cats.size), dtype=float)\n    for j, c in enumerate(cats):\n        B[:, j] = (batches == c).astype(float)\n    return B\n\ndef _ridge_batch_fit_predict(B: np.ndarray, Z: np.ndarray, l2: float = 1e-3):\n    BTB = B.T @ B + l2 * np.eye(B.shape[1], dtype=float)\n    W = np.linalg.solve(BTB, B.T @ Z)\n    return B @ W\n\ndef eliminate_batch_effect_fn(adata:\
    \ ad.AnnData) -> ad.AnnData:\n    \"\"\"\n    Best-known configuration (EID 609 ~ 0.7452):\n    EtC (FWPCA α=0.5; PCA60→ComBat) + BRBG (λ=0.7, γ_max=0.74, PCA50) +\n    Density-Adaptive BBSG (k_total=48, cosine, δ=0.15, k_density=20).\n    Binary edges; true distances; symmetrized neighborhoods.\n    \"\"\"\n    # Config\n    n_pcs_emb = 60\n    n_pcs_graph = 50\n    l2 = 1e-3\n    gamma_max = 0.74\n    lam = 0.7\n    k_total = 48\n    metric = 'cosine'\n    delta = 0.15\n    k_density = 20\n    alpha_var = 0.5\n    emb_n_neighbors = 15\n\n    assert 'batch' in adata.obs.columns and 'feature_name' in adata.var.columns\n\n    # Normalize + HVGs\n    _normalize_log1p_inplace(adata, 1e4)\n    sc.pp.highly_variable_genes(adata, flavor='seurat_v3', batch_key='batch',\n                                n_top_genes=2000, inplace=True)\n    hv = adata.var['highly_variable'].to_numpy()\n    batches = np.asarray(adata.obs['batch'].astype('category').values)\n\n    # Embedding (EtC): FWPCA α=0.5\
    \ → PCA60 → ComBat (analysis/QC only)\n    Xh = adata.X[:, hv]\n    Xd = (Xh.A if sp.issparse(Xh) else Xh).astype(np.float32, copy=False)\n    var_g = Xd.var(axis=0, ddof=1) + 1e-8\n    wv = np.power(var_g, -0.5 * alpha_var).astype(np.float32)\n    Xw = Xd * wv\n    ad_emb = ad.AnnData(Xw, obs=adata.obs[['batch']].copy())\n    sc.pp.pca(ad_emb, n_comps=n_pcs_emb, svd_solver='arpack', random_state=0)\n    Z_emb = ad_emb.obsm['X_pca']\n    ad_pc = ad.AnnData(Z_emb.copy(), obs=adata.obs[['batch']].copy())\n    sc.pp.combat(ad_pc, key='batch')\n    adata.obsm['X_emb'] = np.asarray(ad_pc.X, dtype=np.float32)\n    sc.pp.neighbors(adata, use_rep='X_emb', n_neighbors=emb_n_neighbors, metric=metric)\n\n    # Graph representation: PCA50 → adaptive residualization → Zcorr\n    Zg = _pca_array(Xd, n_comps=n_pcs_graph, random_state=0)\n    B = _one_hot_batches(batches)\n    Zhat = _ridge_batch_fit_predict(B, Zg, l2=l2)\n    var_total = Zg.var(axis=0, ddof=1) + 1e-8\n    var_pred = np.maximum(Zhat.var(axis=0,\
    \ ddof=1), 0.0)\n    R2 = np.clip(var_pred / var_total, 0.0, 1.0)\n    gamma = np.minimum(gamma_max, lam * R2)\n    Zcorr = Zg - (Zhat * gamma)\n\n    # Density-adaptive BBSG (δ=0.15, k_density=20), binary edges + true distances\n    Cg, Dg = build_density_adaptive_bbsg(Zcorr.astype(np.float32), batches=batches,\n                                         k_total=k_total, metric=metric,\n                                         delta=delta, k_density=k_density, rng_seed=0)\n    adata.obsp['connectivities'] = Cg\n    adata.obsp['distances'] = Dg\n    return adata\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station\
    \ again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
